{"conclusion":"Corroborated by contextual review.","disposition":"confirmed","entry_revision_identity":"a6f5804b0c6b36a72c95465c070e9812133d5ff34ec92ea8ee848cfd175e1af1","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"evidence_snapshot":{"content":"原文并列的草药纹身与符文被合并误译为用植物精华纹刻符咒，且“还存在”被误译为“可能存在”","sha256":"029c35d2eee4d0c5c30359977eef8dad83fda541ecb7b3c3b7d75a37ddb98a92"},"observation_contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","observation_identity":"b29d66f2e309f2fcb903ea34f12fc36f9fc298051ee882540d5b7c3e3b52126c","observation_sha256":"029c35d2eee4d0c5c30359977eef8dad83fda541ecb7b3c3b7d75a37ddb98a92","repair_required":true,"schema_version":1}
{"conclusion":"Confirmed by contextual deep review.","disposition":"confirmed","entry_revision_identity":"8cc0b0a2550cbb7e3ff0ef9b3589f5259df295024e3e9fb141bf35b35cf682cd","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"evidence_snapshot":{"content":"术语冲突与机制不符：mod-tome/data/general/objects/egos/wands-powers.lua（commit 624a6732，第 91-95 行）该 keyword 属于 ego \" of conjuration\"，charm 描述为 \"fire a magical bolt dealing %d %s damage\"（火/冰/闪电/酸随机），经 class/Object.lua 第 638-646 行以 \"entity keyword\" 语境拼进物品名，用于提示法杖的攻击型咒法效果；译作「幻化」既不表「咒法/施法攻击」（同版本 ja_JP.lua:10765 作「魔法攻撃」、ko_KR.lua:10885 作「파괴」），又与同一 zh 语料中 Shimmer 系列既有译法冲突（zh_hans.lua:42797/42816/42822/42841/42859 均把 Shimmer 外观系统译为「幻化」），会与外观幻化功能混淆。","sha256":"4b7b7ded8166c88aadd529925a1520be3930886e60de23807b40fc273d996ffe"},"observation_contract":"translation_contextual_v2","observation_identity":"6774f858d9313be879a24ef354dce00c8e0e4f9c05d6b98731aad74ec93f86a3","observation_sha256":"4b7b7ded8166c88aadd529925a1520be3930886e60de23807b40fc273d996ffe","repair_required":true,"schema_version":1}
{"conclusion":"Confirmed by contextual deep review.","disposition":"confirmed","entry_revision_identity":"a65b539836eb555ae472c8c61b99939a0699f6ecbe0f78a222a4ef6b357893b0","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"evidence_snapshot":{"content":"专名误译：mod-tome/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua（commit 624a6732，第 591-618 行）该唯一物品 name=\"Titanic\"，base=BASE_SHIELD，unided_name=\"huge shield\"，desc=\"This shield made of the darkest stralite is huge, heavy and very solid.\"，require str=37、block=320，即取形容词义「巨大无匹」；译作「泰坦尼克」是沉船 Titanic 的专名音译，在中文里指向船名而非盾牌的巨力属性（同版本 ja_JP.lua:12480 取义译「★ギガンテス」）。","sha256":"63f6ee83f715e718303902e9241955b82a093e483ae376fe4027b9a72db7cfdc"},"observation_contract":"translation_contextual_v2","observation_identity":"d804d5ea25504f46b5ed601bba5eb450111e8924282dec74493cab327ef3f940","observation_sha256":"63f6ee83f715e718303902e9241955b82a093e483ae376fe4027b9a72db7cfdc","repair_required":true,"schema_version":1}
{"conclusion":"Confirmed by contextual deep review.","disposition":"confirmed","entry_revision_identity":"a66cfc3d780b5ccdbce63b03b73548cacf025557ea36d1ba706ccf5a3e1a355d","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"evidence_snapshot":{"content":"关系倒置且机制指代错误：mod-tome/data/talents/cursed/fears.lua（commit 624a6732，Tyrant，第 237-256 行）。(1) 原文 \"Impose your tyranny on the minds of those who fear you\" 指「畏惧你的敌人」，译文「对被你恐惧的目标」把施惧方与受惧方对调，读作「你所畏惧的目标」。(2) 原文延长的是 \"their heightened fear and one random existing fear effect\"，其中 heightened fear 是独立具名效果 EFF_HEIGHTEN_FEAR（同文件第 74-80 行由 Heighten Fear 天赋在 applyEffect 中单独施加，第 206-235 行为其天赋定义），与新获得的恐惧（EFF_PARANOID/EFF_DISPAIR/EFF_TERRIFIED/EFF_HAUNTED，第 91-100 行随机选取）不是同一效果；译文「增加这一效果和另一个随机的已有恐惧效果」把延长对象说成「刚获得的新恐惧」，漏掉「加剧恐惧」效果，机制描述错误。","sha256":"9aa003678fb3eedcf8d615cab130d3fe057eed3864486c94640b75d17c5292ec"},"observation_contract":"translation_contextual_v2","observation_identity":"f92eae869b1b5339707fe2f01fc6d077d9de2ba5b232b19c4673c8f9cf42607c","observation_sha256":"9aa003678fb3eedcf8d615cab130d3fe057eed3864486c94640b75d17c5292ec","repair_required":true,"schema_version":1}
{"conclusion":"Confirmed by contextual deep review.","disposition":"confirmed","entry_revision_identity":"a6f5804b0c6b36a72c95465c070e9812133d5ff34ec92ea8ee848cfd175e1af1","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"evidence_snapshot":{"content":"语义合并致来源错误与术语误用：mod-tome/class/interface/TooltipsData.lua（commit 624a6732，TOOLTIP_INSCRIPTIONS，第 160-164 行）。(1) 原文 \"create herbal infusions and runes that can be inscribed on the skin\" 是并列的两类刻印（herbal infusions 与 runes），译文「利用提取的植物精华将一些符咒纹刻到皮肤上」把两类合并为一类，并把 runes 也归因于「植物精华」，与游戏中符文属奥术制品的设定相悖（同句后文即区分 \"the use of runes of various types is also common among arcane users\"）。(2) \"A simple regeneration infusion\" 译为「一种回复纹身」，把 infusion（注能/药剂类刻印）改称「纹身」，与 inscription/infusion/rune 的既有区分不符。","sha256":"5d014d38cfefa9d955440a8a91f977935721204154aed1fa7e3e194bfa315be8"},"observation_contract":"translation_contextual_v2","observation_identity":"8fbd6a1cb6269297f48426016e6783c9724b730449831fd0a6a2dea2897241d5","observation_sha256":"5d014d38cfefa9d955440a8a91f977935721204154aed1fa7e3e194bfa315be8","repair_required":true,"schema_version":1}
